ARC or PLC in Licking County","/arc-plc/ohio/licking-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Licking County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 47% of normal on the middle, while May to June in 2025 hit 150%. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 63% of normal on the middle. Grid 24190 had its driest year in 1963 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
